cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Simulusion in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Simulusion: A Modular PyTorch Library for World Models"
abstract: >-
  Simulusion (formerly TorchWM) brings world-model algorithms - Dreamer, PlaNet,
  IRIS, DIAMOND, JEPA, DiT and Genie - together under one PyTorch API for
  training, evaluating and deploying them across environments.
authors:
